                                "sense_id": "0d0c8926-e848-3838-b175-fd7f3079e1af",
                                "text": "Now then, the biggest whales, those rorqual whales that frequent the waterways of the Aleutian Islands, have never exceeded a length of 56 meters--if they reach even that."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
